flowchart TB
    A[Request fields] --> H1[Request hash]
    B[Ordered role results] --> H2[Role-evidence hash]
    C[Terminal decision] --> R[Receipt constructor]
    H1 --> R
    H2 --> R
    D[Optional previous receipt hash] --> R
    R --> RH[Receipt hash]
    RH --> P[Governed return payload]
    P --> PH[Return-payload hash]
    H1 --> W[Reconstruction witness]
    H2 --> W
    RH --> W
    PH --> W
    W --> WH[Reconstruction hash]
